6-saved-on-11-4-2025.pdf","source_title":"2025–2026 Undergraduate Catalog | Stevenson University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located at Owings Mills North; room availability and reservation procedures may vary by term.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"owings-mills-library","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Owings Mills Library","title":"Owings Mills Library","subtitle":"Brown School of Business and Leadership, Owings Mills","notes":"Start research here when you need print sources or legal-studies materials, then ask library staff about finding additional academic resources.","short_summary":"A campus library with broad print holdings and the Legal Studies print collection.","evidence_claim":"Stevenson's 2025–26 catalog places the Owings Mills Library in the Brown School of Business and Leadership and notes its print legal collection.","source_url":"https://www.stevenson.edu/wp-content/uploads/PDF-VERSION-10-23-25-Stevenson-Undergraduate-Catalog-25-26-saved-on-11-4-2025.pdf","source_title":"2025–2026 Undergraduate Catalog | Stevenson University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Library access and service hours can change; check Stevenson Library for current hours before a dedicated study trip.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"school-of-design-gallery","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"School of Design Gallery","title":"School of Design Gallery","subtitle":"School of Design, Owings Mills North","notes":"Drop in to view current design-focused exhibitions, or plan around a gallery talk; the space adjoins the School of Design’s atrium lobby.","short_summary":"A free gallery for exhibitions in design, illustration, photography, motion graphics, and video.","evidence_claim":"Stevenson says the School of Design Gallery is free and open to all, and that it presents design-related exhibitions.","source_url":"https://www.stevenson.edu/about/arts-cultural-programs/art-exhibitions/","source_title":"Art Exhibitions | Stevenson University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Stevenson lists gallery hours as Monday–Friday 11 a.m.–7 p.m. and Saturday 11 a.m.–4 p.m.; closed Sunday.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
